WEBVTT


00:03:02.375 --> 00:03:03.625
Look, Kuba!


00:03:05.833 --> 00:03:07.291
They're flying away.


00:03:59.833 --> 00:04:01.750
Hanka! Come over here!


00:04:02.541 --> 00:04:05.958
God's blessed you with
a good potato harvest.


00:04:06.583 --> 00:04:07.666
Aye, indeed!


00:04:07.708 --> 00:04:10.708
She said the baby
had a spud nose.


00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:13.708
The spitting image of Boryna!


00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:14.958
No!


00:04:15.291 --> 00:04:18.083
Many a young lass
would chase after him!


00:04:20.333 --> 00:04:23.916
They had no room for her!
Neither in hallway or barn!


00:04:23.958 --> 00:04:25.666
Just like mine!


00:04:25.708 --> 00:04:29.458
The plague-ridden
scum. Her own children!


00:04:31.125 --> 00:04:33.291
Come get that wool your
mother left, Magda.


00:04:33.333 --> 00:04:37.333
Why? Father won't hand over
anything, even her clothes.


00:04:37.375 --> 00:04:38.416
Jagna, come!


00:04:40.833 --> 00:04:42.666
So dressed up!


00:04:43.666 --> 00:04:45.291
What a necklace you've got!


00:04:45.333 --> 00:04:48.125
Just some alder branch
I found, I cut it and...


00:04:48.166 --> 00:04:50.208
Beautiful and talented!


00:04:50.916 --> 00:04:55.708
A rich widower for this one!


00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:57.708
I'm not rocking
someone else's cradle.


00:04:57.750 --> 00:05:00.041
There's nothing to worry about!


00:05:00.083 --> 00:05:02.291
His are already weaned.


00:05:03.416 --> 00:05:04.583
I'm fine where I am.


00:05:04.625 --> 00:05:07.208
Fine or not, one day you'll
have to fly the nest.


00:05:07.958 --> 00:05:09.750
The husband you get,


00:05:09.791 --> 00:05:11.583
the farm you get.


00:05:11.625 --> 00:05:13.333
And the woman you become.


00:05:13.375 --> 00:05:14.791
I don't care about that.


00:05:14.833 --> 00:05:16.291
Don't talk rubbish, Jagna!


00:05:16.333 --> 00:05:20.916
She's young still; Says
whatever comes into her head.


00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:43.666
And don't think that you
can slink off to the Inn!


00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:45.750
You'll feel my whip if you do.


00:05:45.791 --> 00:05:47.083
Come on, Mama!


00:05:52.083 --> 00:05:53.458
And you?


00:05:53.500 --> 00:05:55.208
Don't you cause
me worries enough!


00:05:55.958 --> 00:05:57.208
What did I do?


00:05:57.625 --> 00:05:59.500
Talking back to
the Mayor's wife!


00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:01.833
Do you want them to
speak ill of you?


00:06:02.333 --> 00:06:04.083
I didn't mean to offend her.


00:06:05.541 --> 00:06:07.125
I'm just happy here with you.


00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:12.125
My dear child.


00:06:14.708 --> 00:06:16.875
What's going on at Boryna's?


00:06:26.458 --> 00:06:29.375
I'll not be ringing the
bell for her funeral;


00:06:30.458 --> 00:06:32.541
Clink your pots instead.


00:06:32.583 --> 00:06:36.125
Daddy! Rosey is dying!


00:06:36.166 --> 00:06:39.166
Jambrozy has bled her. Nothing!


00:06:39.208 --> 00:06:41.250
Then we put melted
wax down her throat.


00:06:41.291 --> 00:06:42.333
Still nothing!


00:06:42.375 --> 00:06:43.958
Our best cow!


00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:46.958
Devil twist your guts if
that's how you mind her.


00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:50.083
You're always ready
to eat my food,


00:06:50.125 --> 00:06:51.416
but lend a hand - never!


00:06:51.458 --> 00:06:53.583
I've been out digging
potatoes all afternoon!


00:06:53.625 --> 00:06:55.458
Like you ever notice a thing!


00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:02.500
Scum! Wasting such a beast!


00:07:04.166 --> 00:07:05.291
What?


00:07:05.333 --> 00:07:07.875
Snivelling again! It's
all you're good for!


00:07:07.916 --> 00:07:09.666
Leave her alone.


00:07:09.708 --> 00:07:12.083
- Don't attack my wife.
- And you're no better!


00:07:12.125 --> 00:07:14.000
What do you ever do
for this household?


00:07:14.041 --> 00:07:15.458
What am I? Your farmhand?


00:07:15.916 --> 00:07:18.833
I work like an ox for
nothing. Not even a good word.


00:07:18.875 --> 00:07:20.708
Shut up before I lose my temper!


00:07:21.291 --> 00:07:24.458
You live on my land, eat my food.
Too much bread's making you bold!


00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:27.541
Don't reproach me with the bread
I'm owed by my forefathers.


00:07:27.583 --> 00:07:30.708
Passed to you as you should
now pass it on to me.


00:07:31.916 --> 00:07:34.791
I doubled this land
with these hands.


00:07:35.333 --> 00:07:38.166
And while these hands
can work, it stays mine.


00:07:39.208 --> 00:07:41.750
If you don't like it,
try your luck elsewhere.


00:07:43.375 --> 00:07:46.291
Maybe on Hanka's three acres
you can eat fresh rolls daily!


00:07:46.791 --> 00:07:50.041
I'd even eat mouldy potatoes, if
they weren't thrown in my face!


00:08:03.291 --> 00:08:05.416
Father wants you
to cut up the cow.


00:08:11.541 --> 00:08:12.875
I'm no butcher.


00:08:18.458 --> 00:08:20.541
Must you always fight with him?


00:08:20.583 --> 00:08:21.958
He's your father.


00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:24.916
For us, for our children,
make peace with him.


00:08:28.083 --> 00:08:29.416
Come on, Antek.


00:08:30.416 --> 00:08:32.000
You make peace if you want.


00:08:35.041 --> 00:08:36.791
But don't tell me what to do.


00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:47.666
With no mistress in the house,


00:08:48.291 --> 00:08:49.958
things drain away,


00:08:50.291 --> 00:08:51.875
like through a sieve.


00:08:57.291 --> 00:08:58.666
Time to marry!


00:08:58.708 --> 00:08:59.875
And that's that!


00:09:00.666 --> 00:09:02.125
You're joking!


00:09:02.666 --> 00:09:04.833
My wife is scarcely
cold in her grave!


00:09:04.875 --> 00:09:06.708
The whole village would talk!


00:09:06.750 --> 00:09:08.416
Eat, eat!


00:09:10.708 --> 00:09:12.000
Listen, Boryna!


00:09:12.875 --> 00:09:15.333
There are so many
unwed lasses here,


00:09:15.833 --> 00:09:17.791
that when a man goes
about the houses,


00:09:19.416 --> 00:09:21.208
he smoulders hot as a stove.


00:09:22.541 --> 00:09:23.791
Take Zośka,


00:09:25.708 --> 00:09:26.875
slender, a hard worker,


00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:28.791
and not a bad dowry.


00:09:28.833 --> 00:09:30.666
She's a grumpy shrew,


00:09:30.708 --> 00:09:32.250
and has one thick hip.


00:09:33.166 --> 00:09:34.625
What's he need her dowry for?


00:09:34.666 --> 00:09:37.041
Isn't he the richest
farmer in the village?


00:09:40.666 --> 00:09:43.083
Well, Weronika,
Staszek's daughter.


00:09:43.125 --> 00:09:44.250
Taken.


00:09:45.125 --> 00:09:47.750
Roch's son sent her
vodka yesterday.


00:09:51.125 --> 00:09:53.041
Jagna Dominikowa?


00:09:57.208 --> 00:09:58.541
A fine lass!


00:09:58.583 --> 00:09:59.875
Jagna?


00:10:01.625 --> 00:10:04.000
They say she chases the lads.


00:10:04.416 --> 00:10:05.416
Oh yes?


00:10:06.083 --> 00:10:07.458
Seen her have they?


00:10:08.833 --> 00:10:13.291
People gossip just
for the hell of it.


00:10:31.208 --> 00:10:32.208
Take care!


00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:34.500
I'll be back.


00:10:35.083 --> 00:10:36.208
Don't worry!


00:10:47.458 --> 00:10:49.000
God bless.


00:10:50.916 --> 00:10:52.916
Is your Jasio off
on his studies?


00:10:54.708 --> 00:10:57.583
He'll be back soon
enough. I shouldn't fuss.


00:10:57.625 --> 00:10:59.208
He's going to the seminary,


00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:00.250
to be a priest.


00:11:01.041 --> 00:11:03.833
You've brought herbs!


00:11:04.333 --> 00:11:08.041
Thank you. Give your
mother our blessings.


00:11:09.583 --> 00:11:12.208
The priest talks so well of her.


00:11:12.833 --> 00:11:14.250
Such a wise woman.


00:11:14.291 --> 00:11:16.541
Wait. I'll give you
something for these.


00:11:16.583 --> 00:11:18.083
Mother said there's no need.


00:11:18.541 --> 00:11:20.875
Don't be silly! I insist.


00:11:28.416 --> 00:11:29.500
Poor thing.


00:11:29.916 --> 00:11:31.166
Its wing is broken!


00:11:33.083 --> 00:11:34.583
Will you take him, Jagna?


00:11:34.875 --> 00:11:37.250
I can't. Father would
kick him out, for sure!


00:11:37.958 --> 00:11:39.375
Take Storky.


00:11:39.833 --> 00:11:41.333
I'll cure him before spring.


00:11:42.125 --> 00:11:45.041
I'll feed him and everything.


00:11:45.083 --> 00:11:46.125
Take him!


00:11:46.166 --> 00:11:47.750
Do take him, Jagna!


00:11:47.791 --> 00:11:51.541
Maybe I could find room
somewhere in the barn.


00:11:51.583 --> 00:11:53.333
Hatching some plan, are you?


00:11:55.416 --> 00:11:57.208
Antek, don't tell father.


00:11:57.250 --> 00:11:58.625
Why would I, Jozka?


00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:02.375
Better be off, father's
looking for you.


00:12:16.541 --> 00:12:18.416
You really want
this scrawny thing?


00:12:19.375 --> 00:12:20.750
I really do.


00:12:38.333 --> 00:12:39.500
Have you heard?


00:12:40.583 --> 00:12:42.041
The Squire's driving


00:12:42.500 --> 00:12:44.833
everyone's livestock
out of Wolf's Hollow!


00:12:44.875 --> 00:12:47.875
All that land, the scum! And he
begrudges us our grazing rights!


00:12:54.958 --> 00:12:58.500
They say your son-in-law
means to take you to court.


00:12:58.541 --> 00:13:01.375
That bloody blacksmith!


00:13:02.458 --> 00:13:05.916
Running amok, the lot of
'em! Coveting what's mine.


00:13:07.666 --> 00:13:11.416
They might back off if
you were to marry again.


00:13:15.166 --> 00:13:17.458
I'll not take the first
lass to cross my path.


00:13:18.625 --> 00:13:21.541
Throw in a gift of land, and even the
very best of them won't hold back.


00:13:22.541 --> 00:13:25.375
For land, like sows to a trough!


00:13:25.625 --> 00:13:27.791
Are the boys any different?
Always sniffing around,


00:13:28.125 --> 00:13:29.875
like dogs, for a dowry!


00:13:41.625 --> 00:13:44.375
They say the squire wants
to sell Wolf's Hollow.


00:13:44.416 --> 00:13:46.125
He can want all he likes,


00:13:46.166 --> 00:13:49.333
but we have wood gathering
and grazing rights there.


00:13:49.583 --> 00:13:51.541
Sue him then.


00:13:53.083 --> 00:13:55.875
Who has time for the courts when's
there's so much work before winter?


00:13:56.666 --> 00:13:59.250
How true! The burdens we bear!


00:14:38.125 --> 00:14:39.500
Three notes!


00:15:06.875 --> 00:15:08.833
Ladies boots! With
laces and heels!


00:15:09.875 --> 00:15:11.750
And greased with fat!


00:15:31.500 --> 00:15:33.625
It's a good look for you!


00:15:37.208 --> 00:15:38.500
How much?


00:15:38.541 --> 00:15:39.666
Three notes.


00:15:42.416 --> 00:15:43.500
I'll take it.


00:15:51.416 --> 00:15:54.000
You'd make a fine farmboy!


00:15:55.083 --> 00:15:56.166
Or not.


00:15:57.125 --> 00:15:58.708
I'd hire you in an instant.


00:15:59.541 --> 00:16:00.916
I'd be too expensive.


00:16:00.958 --> 00:16:01.958
For some,


00:16:02.875 --> 00:16:05.083
but you couldn't be
too expensive for me.


00:16:05.125 --> 00:16:06.791
And I wouldn't
work in the fields!


00:16:11.583 --> 00:16:13.750
I'd do all the work for you.


00:16:27.666 --> 00:16:28.875
Jagna!


00:16:31.458 --> 00:16:32.458
Take this.


00:16:33.166 --> 00:16:34.500
I bought it for you.


00:16:35.541 --> 00:16:37.333
Pure silk.


00:16:40.458 --> 00:16:42.708
- I can't!
- Take it, Jagna.


00:16:44.041 --> 00:16:47.291
And when some young peasant brings
round the vodka, don't drink it...


00:16:48.916 --> 00:16:50.666
Why be in a hurry?


00:16:56.333 --> 00:16:57.416
I said seven!


00:16:57.833 --> 00:17:00.041
Six and a half! It has blight!


00:17:00.083 --> 00:17:02.000
Your face will be
blighted after I punch it!


00:17:02.041 --> 00:17:03.416
The wheat's pure as gold!


00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:11.958
People are saying I
should take you to court.


00:17:15.958 --> 00:17:17.125
Go ahead!


00:17:17.166 --> 00:17:20.208
Give Magda the land
that is rightfully hers.


00:17:20.250 --> 00:17:22.416
I'll not take it to
the grave with me;


00:17:22.458 --> 00:17:24.708
But while I've
breath in my body,


00:17:24.750 --> 00:17:26.500
I'll not give up a single acre.


00:17:27.083 --> 00:17:29.250
Then pay us the value,
of those two acres.


00:17:31.625 --> 00:17:32.833
Enough!


00:17:33.875 --> 00:17:38.958
A man has a need for money when
he's on the lookout for a new wife.


00:17:41.416 --> 00:17:42.750
Sure!


00:17:46.291 --> 00:17:48.666
If I choose to, I'll marry.


00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:50.875
Any objections?


00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:52.875
Objections? No, but...


00:17:52.916 --> 00:17:55.791
I might even send
vodka tomorrow.


00:17:55.833 --> 00:17:57.000
Do so!


00:17:57.041 --> 00:17:58.291
Why would I mind?


00:18:03.500 --> 00:18:06.041
But give us the calf at least,


00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:08.291
Rosey's one,


00:18:08.875 --> 00:18:09.958
and I'll even help you.


00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:11.000
You'll help,


00:18:11.250 --> 00:18:12.333
will you.


00:18:12.625 --> 00:18:13.666
Jambrozy!


00:18:14.125 --> 00:18:16.000
Come, drink with us.


00:18:33.458 --> 00:18:35.166
What are you thinking
about, Jagna?


00:18:37.208 --> 00:18:38.875
Oh, nothing much.


00:18:44.666 --> 00:18:46.000
How's the stork? Better?


00:18:46.958 --> 00:18:48.625
Better, thank you.


00:18:59.583 --> 00:19:02.416
I'd like to hang
onto those clouds,


00:19:02.458 --> 00:19:04.625
and float far away with them.


00:19:08.666 --> 00:19:10.250
I'd go with you.


00:19:12.125 --> 00:19:13.250
Would you like that?


00:19:29.416 --> 00:19:32.500
<i>There were two people,</i>


00:19:32.916 --> 00:19:35.500
<i>and both were young.</i>


00:19:36.208 --> 00:19:38.458
<i>Day by day, night by night,</i>


00:19:38.500 --> 00:19:40.791
<i>there was hunger,
there was passion,</i>


00:19:40.833 --> 00:19:44.000
<i>And both were young.</i>


00:19:44.458 --> 00:19:48.208
<i>And from their
whispers, came a...</i>


00:19:48.875 --> 00:19:50.166
Shut it!


00:19:50.208 --> 00:19:54.583
Sounds like you're
being skinned alive.


00:19:55.333 --> 00:19:58.708
<i>came a child!</i>


00:19:59.291 --> 00:20:01.416
<i>Day by day, night by night,</i>


00:20:01.458 --> 00:20:03.625
<i>there was hunger,
there was passion,</i>


00:20:03.666 --> 00:20:07.375
<i>and there came a child!</i>


00:20:09.125 --> 00:20:12.583
<i>There were two people,</i>


00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:17.125
<i>and both were young.</i>


00:20:17.583 --> 00:20:19.541
<i>Day by day, night by night,</i>


00:20:19.583 --> 00:20:21.625
<i>There was hunger,
there was passion,</i>


00:20:21.666 --> 00:20:24.958
<i>And both were young.</i>


00:20:25.833 --> 00:20:29.750
<i>And from their
whispers, came a...</i>


00:20:34.375 --> 00:20:37.416
Did you hear that tomorrow
Walek is sending vodka


00:20:37.458 --> 00:20:38.875
to Ala Paciotkowa?


00:20:38.916 --> 00:20:42.083
- Is she already old enough?
- Barely, but she's got so much land


00:20:42.125 --> 00:20:43.541
that lads are in a hurry.


00:20:43.583 --> 00:20:45.875
They'll line up for
you too for sure!


00:20:45.916 --> 00:20:48.583
If your daddy doesn't
spend your dowry


00:20:48.625 --> 00:20:50.541
on a new wife first!


00:20:51.125 --> 00:20:52.750
Stop spouting nonsense.


00:20:52.791 --> 00:20:54.791
Father only buried
mother in the spring.


00:20:54.833 --> 00:20:56.458
What does that matter to a man?


00:20:57.291 --> 00:20:59.208
Every one is a pig,


00:20:59.250 --> 00:21:02.375
always ready to
thrust his snout,


00:21:02.416 --> 00:21:04.666
into a fresh trough.


00:21:05.708 --> 00:21:08.333
Come on, Jagna! I'm
soaked to the bone.


00:21:08.375 --> 00:21:10.125
If you meet Antek,


00:21:10.166 --> 00:21:12.125
tell him to hurry!


00:21:12.166 --> 00:21:13.916
Hail Mary, full of grace...


00:21:14.291 --> 00:21:15.791
Hurry! Let's hurry!


00:21:15.833 --> 00:21:17.375
Move, come on!


00:21:19.666 --> 00:21:21.250
Come on, girl! Come on!


00:21:23.541 --> 00:21:24.541
Go!


00:21:24.958 --> 00:21:26.333
Move your arse!


00:21:33.166 --> 00:21:34.416
Jagna!


00:21:34.458 --> 00:21:35.458
Jagna!


00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:38.125
You shouldn't have loaded
so much on one horse.


00:21:38.583 --> 00:21:41.083
I'm not doing two
trips in this weather!


00:21:41.541 --> 00:21:43.000
We'll push. On three.


00:21:43.583 --> 00:21:46.583
One, two... THREE!


00:21:54.416 --> 00:21:56.625
Go on! A little more!


00:21:56.666 --> 00:21:58.333
You're clear now, Szymek!


00:21:59.333 --> 00:22:01.041
God be with you,
Antek, thank you!


00:22:01.083 --> 00:22:02.958
- Jagna!
- You go on!


00:22:15.791 --> 00:22:17.375
Hanka is waiting for you!


00:22:20.333 --> 00:22:22.583
I'll walk you to
the Mill, Jagna.


00:22:22.625 --> 00:22:24.375
The water has caused
a breach there.


00:22:24.875 --> 00:22:26.291
It got so dark, hasn't it?


00:22:27.208 --> 00:22:28.291
Are you afraid?


00:22:28.916 --> 00:22:30.416
Why would I be?


00:22:35.416 --> 00:22:37.541
You coming to the
cabbage party tomorrow?


00:22:39.208 --> 00:22:40.333
Go now!


00:22:40.375 --> 00:22:41.875
They are waiting for you!


00:22:47.916 --> 00:22:49.000
Will you come?


00:22:50.000 --> 00:22:51.250
I will!


00:23:03.166 --> 00:23:04.166
Hey!


00:23:04.500 --> 00:23:06.000
Off with you!


00:23:06.500 --> 00:23:08.208
Ala and Walek got engaged!


00:23:08.875 --> 00:23:10.625
She'll be a beautiful bride.


00:23:10.666 --> 00:23:13.166
She bought such pretty
ribbons at the market.


00:23:13.208 --> 00:23:15.166
Beautiful for a day.


00:23:15.208 --> 00:23:19.125
Until they chop off her
plaits at the unveiling.


00:23:19.166 --> 00:23:21.958
Then the lad will
have a surprise!


00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:24.583
Jagustynka, never a
good word for anyone.


00:23:24.625 --> 00:23:26.333
What? I'm just
telling how it is.


00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:28.666
It comes to all of us!


00:23:32.875 --> 00:23:34.708
Let's have 'em, let's have 'em!


00:23:34.750 --> 00:23:37.416
Colourful as a field of flowers!


00:23:37.458 --> 00:23:39.958
All dressed up, the
lasses, like a wedding!


00:23:41.250 --> 00:23:45.166
Planning on marrying
cabbages, are you, girls?


00:23:46.083 --> 00:23:47.541
Did you hear that
Mateusz is back?


00:23:47.583 --> 00:23:51.000
They say he built the Counsellor's
house all by himself in just 6 months.


00:23:51.416 --> 00:23:53.500
He made us a new
hen house in a day.


00:23:53.958 --> 00:23:55.208
He's an able craftsman!


00:23:55.250 --> 00:23:56.541
Able indeed!


00:23:56.583 --> 00:23:59.333
I'll bet he'll be able
to make something new


00:23:59.375 --> 00:24:02.166
pop up in the
village in 9 months.


00:24:03.083 --> 00:24:04.166
Lukasz!


00:24:04.666 --> 00:24:05.875
Play some music!


00:24:19.166 --> 00:24:24.375
Well, ladies, all this work
must be making you thirsty.


00:24:26.875 --> 00:24:29.000
Jagusia, some bread and lard.


00:24:32.916 --> 00:24:33.916
Give me some!


00:24:33.958 --> 00:24:35.750
For you, and for you!


00:24:39.583 --> 00:24:41.208
I don't like the taste of vodka.


00:24:42.875 --> 00:24:44.125
One for you, Jagustynka.


00:24:49.875 --> 00:24:50.875
Your health!


00:24:50.916 --> 00:24:52.625
Your health! Your health!


00:25:02.500 --> 00:25:03.500
Bravo!


00:25:03.541 --> 00:25:05.333
Bravo, musicians!


00:25:05.375 --> 00:25:06.916
Thank you for the hospitality.


00:25:07.458 --> 00:25:10.291
- But I have to run now.
- You didn't even eat anything.


00:25:10.333 --> 00:25:11.916
Mother's expecting me.


00:25:11.958 --> 00:25:13.333
God be with you.


00:25:13.375 --> 00:25:15.041
God be with you.


00:27:03.708 --> 00:27:04.750
That one's me.


00:27:06.166 --> 00:27:07.916
Flying before all others.


00:27:09.500 --> 00:27:10.541
No.


00:27:11.291 --> 00:27:12.583
This one's like you.


00:27:13.208 --> 00:27:15.083
So bulky he might
fall out of the sky.


00:27:16.750 --> 00:27:18.375
And then he'd crush


00:27:19.583 --> 00:27:21.416
some pretty girl below.


00:27:31.416 --> 00:27:32.416
This is you.


00:27:36.250 --> 00:27:38.416
I'm like dirt to you?


00:27:41.083 --> 00:27:42.083
No...


00:27:45.375 --> 00:27:47.291
You are like holy soil.


00:27:48.250 --> 00:27:50.125
That brings life.


00:27:52.375 --> 00:27:54.500
You bring me to life.


00:28:00.250 --> 00:28:01.625
Yes! Come in!


00:28:04.083 --> 00:28:05.375
Praised be.


00:28:05.416 --> 00:28:06.416
Praised be.


00:28:07.083 --> 00:28:09.666
Mark you that a man of
importance has come to see you!


00:28:10.250 --> 00:28:11.791
- And why!
- I'm listening.


00:28:22.708 --> 00:28:24.208
You're a wise woman.


00:28:24.250 --> 00:28:28.000
So you know that
sooner or later Jagna


00:28:28.875 --> 00:28:30.458
has to leave home.


00:28:42.916 --> 00:28:45.666
I am bringing this from the
first farmer in the village.


00:28:46.375 --> 00:28:48.416
Shall we drink to that, Mother?


00:28:49.000 --> 00:28:51.916
Drink away, but you
haven't said yet who it is.


00:28:52.708 --> 00:28:54.208
Who?


00:28:57.916 --> 00:28:59.541
Why, Boryna himself!


00:28:59.583 --> 00:29:00.916
An old widower!


00:29:00.958 --> 00:29:03.208
Old? But recently in court
for fathering a child!


00:29:04.375 --> 00:29:05.458
True


00:29:06.875 --> 00:29:08.333
except it wasn't his.


00:29:08.375 --> 00:29:09.708
Of course it wasn't!


00:29:10.208 --> 00:29:12.625
A farmer like him with
a wench like that?


00:29:12.666 --> 00:29:14.458
Let's drink, mother!


00:29:14.916 --> 00:29:18.916
I could, but he's more likely on his
way to having a beer with angels above.


00:29:18.958 --> 00:29:21.166
Then what? The kids
kick the stepmother out.


00:29:21.208 --> 00:29:23.333
No, that's not for us!


00:29:23.375 --> 00:29:25.000
A bride's price!


00:29:25.541 --> 00:29:27.208
Maciej promised a
land settlement.


00:29:27.250 --> 00:29:28.291
For Jagna.


00:29:29.583 --> 00:29:30.583
I...


00:29:31.583 --> 00:29:32.583
the Mayor, swear it.


00:29:37.750 --> 00:29:38.750
Well


00:29:44.416 --> 00:29:45.583
we'll think on it.


00:29:47.291 --> 00:29:48.875
Drink, Jagna.


00:29:50.708 --> 00:29:51.708
Drink.


00:29:53.583 --> 00:29:54.791
We've got you a man


00:29:56.250 --> 00:29:57.541
as solid as an oak.


00:29:57.583 --> 00:29:58.666
You'll be


00:29:59.375 --> 00:30:00.875
the first lady of the village.


00:30:03.666 --> 00:30:04.916
Drink up!


00:30:06.958 --> 00:30:08.416
I said, drink.


00:30:11.000 --> 00:30:12.458
Drink, Jagna!


00:30:18.708 --> 00:30:20.458
- Jagna!
- Leave her, mother.


00:30:41.958 --> 00:30:43.291
I told you already, Mateusz!


00:30:43.750 --> 00:30:45.250
You did, you did


00:30:46.250 --> 00:30:47.666
what did you tell me?


00:30:48.958 --> 00:30:50.666
To let me go!


00:30:50.708 --> 00:30:52.708
I just want to talk to you.


00:30:54.458 --> 00:30:56.291
Be quick. I've work to do!


00:30:59.208 --> 00:31:00.708
Your mother wants to sell you.


00:31:02.083 --> 00:31:03.875
Like a heifer on market day.


00:31:06.958 --> 00:31:08.375
You'll go with the old man?


00:31:09.625 --> 00:31:11.208
If she tells me to, I will.


00:31:11.250 --> 00:31:12.875
Do you think I have a say in it?


00:31:13.333 --> 00:31:14.375
You do!


00:31:14.416 --> 00:31:15.833
Just tell her


00:31:16.583 --> 00:31:17.833
what you want!


00:31:17.875 --> 00:31:19.166
Sure.


00:31:19.583 --> 00:31:21.791
That's easy for you to say.


00:31:24.875 --> 00:31:25.875
Jagna.


00:31:27.500 --> 00:31:29.833
- Back from the world already?
- I'm back.


00:31:29.875 --> 00:31:31.958
- Mother.
- A bitch was your mother, not me!


00:31:32.000 --> 00:31:33.800
Why've you come? There's
nothing for you here!


00:31:33.833 --> 00:31:35.375
I've come to see Jagna,


00:31:35.875 --> 00:31:36.916
not you.


00:31:36.958 --> 00:31:38.958
Stay away from
Jagna, do you hear?


00:31:39.000 --> 00:31:42.000
People have maligned her enough
in the village on your account!


00:31:50.750 --> 00:31:53.541
I'll sign over those three acres


00:31:54.041 --> 00:31:55.666
next to Michael's to her.


00:31:56.875 --> 00:31:59.666
Her late father left her
five, and one of forest.


00:31:59.708 --> 00:32:01.666
Match that and give her six!


00:32:01.708 --> 00:32:02.666
What!


00:32:02.708 --> 00:32:06.333
Those by the road are best,
where you grow potatoes.


00:32:06.958 --> 00:32:08.833
Those are the pick of my fields!


00:32:08.875 --> 00:32:10.916
And isn't Jagna the
pick of the village?


00:32:11.458 --> 00:32:13.208
I suppose.


00:32:15.958 --> 00:32:19.500
But God in heaven, six acres?
That's more than a farm to most.


00:32:19.541 --> 00:32:22.166
No one'll take it as
long as you're living,


00:32:22.208 --> 00:32:25.333
and remember the
fields from her father


00:32:25.375 --> 00:32:26.416
will be yours,


00:32:26.458 --> 00:32:28.666
you can sow them immediately!


00:32:33.791 --> 00:32:35.583
Your health!


00:32:36.791 --> 00:32:39.583
Play musicians! Let's dance!


00:33:29.916 --> 00:33:31.541
You're on Father's side!


00:33:31.583 --> 00:33:32.875
I'm on the side of order.


00:33:33.500 --> 00:33:35.291
Paid you off well, has he?


00:33:36.000 --> 00:33:37.666
Not from your pocket.


00:33:37.708 --> 00:33:40.208
Oh it's from mine,
son-of-a-bitch, mine!


00:33:41.583 --> 00:33:44.083
You've taken enough already,
so you're not in a hurry!


00:33:44.583 --> 00:33:47.000
Like that calf he just
gave you? Is that nothing?


00:33:47.875 --> 00:33:49.416
You could have taken it too.


00:33:49.458 --> 00:33:50.791
Except I'm not a thief!


00:33:52.958 --> 00:33:54.041
I'm a thief, am I?


00:33:54.083 --> 00:33:55.541
Hey, hey!


00:33:55.583 --> 00:33:56.791
I'm a man of office!


00:33:57.208 --> 00:33:58.750
Easy, Antek, or you'll be sorry!


00:33:58.791 --> 00:34:01.625
And you're nothing but a drunk.
A Judas and an embezzler!


00:34:02.291 --> 00:34:04.416
I bet he paid you both
well to defend him!


00:34:04.458 --> 00:34:05.958
It seems to me, Antek


00:34:07.458 --> 00:34:09.875
that it's not the land
that's bugging you.


00:34:09.916 --> 00:34:12.208
- What then?
- You've been chasing after Jagna,


00:34:13.875 --> 00:34:15.375
and now you're sulking.


00:34:17.750 --> 00:34:19.166
Leave him!


00:34:19.208 --> 00:34:20.208
Antek!


00:34:22.041 --> 00:34:23.041
Leave him!


00:34:31.666 --> 00:34:32.750
And on the second day,


00:34:32.791 --> 00:34:34.458
when all the people had left,


00:34:34.500 --> 00:34:36.125
and Blessed Virgin,


00:34:36.166 --> 00:34:38.083
and the Holy Apostles were gone,


00:34:38.500 --> 00:34:40.083
only the little dog was left.


00:34:41.000 --> 00:34:44.125
- And he sat and howled...
- Do you ever shut up?


00:34:44.666 --> 00:34:46.416
Why are you jumping
down her throat?


00:34:47.666 --> 00:34:48.666
Your health!


00:34:49.875 --> 00:34:50.916
Your health.


00:34:52.375 --> 00:34:54.458
You've signed over a
whole six acres to Jagna!


00:34:55.250 --> 00:34:56.666
Because I chose to.


00:34:56.958 --> 00:34:59.458
And if I choose, I can sign
over everything to her.


00:35:02.166 --> 00:35:04.791
You could, if it
belonged only to you.


00:35:05.375 --> 00:35:06.666
Who else's is it?


00:35:09.541 --> 00:35:10.541
Who else's, tell me!


00:35:13.375 --> 00:35:14.125
Ours.


00:35:14.375 --> 00:35:15.041
Fool.


00:35:15.375 --> 00:35:16.666
The land is mine,


00:35:17.458 --> 00:35:19.291
and I'll do whatever
I want with it.


00:35:22.083 --> 00:35:25.000
- We won't let you take what's ours!
- Hark at her!


00:35:26.791 --> 00:35:29.750
Brings us three worthless acres of
sand, and now she's giving me lip!


00:35:33.000 --> 00:35:35.875
If your lot is so bad here,
go find something better.


00:35:37.708 --> 00:35:40.250
We're not going anywhere,
because our land is here.


00:35:41.041 --> 00:35:43.041
Give it to her if you want to.


00:35:43.083 --> 00:35:45.541
But divide the rest
among your children:


00:35:45.583 --> 00:35:47.750
Antek, Magda and Jozka.


00:35:47.791 --> 00:35:50.583
Look at her, now she's
dividing up my land!


00:35:50.625 --> 00:35:52.416
We only want what's just!


00:35:52.458 --> 00:35:55.000
You'll get justice at
the end of my stick!


00:35:55.041 --> 00:35:57.583
Lift a finger against
her and you'll not live


00:35:57.625 --> 00:35:58.833
to see your wedding day.


00:35:58.875 --> 00:36:01.125
Six of our best
acres, settled on her!


00:36:01.875 --> 00:36:03.250
Mother's clothing,


00:36:03.291 --> 00:36:04.750
her beads, everything!


00:36:05.416 --> 00:36:06.458
And for who?


00:36:07.250 --> 00:36:09.541
For who? For that dirty sow!


00:36:12.666 --> 00:36:13.875
What did you say?


00:36:13.916 --> 00:36:15.375
She's a dirty whore,


00:36:15.791 --> 00:36:18.083
and all the village knows it!


00:36:18.750 --> 00:36:21.375
- The whole world even!
- Don't you dare,


00:36:21.416 --> 00:36:23.750
or I'll beat your
foul mouth to a pulp!


00:36:24.791 --> 00:36:26.041
I'll say it too!


00:36:26.083 --> 00:36:28.333
That your Jagna's
a common whore,


00:36:28.375 --> 00:36:29.375
you hear me?


00:36:29.958 --> 00:36:31.333
Whoever wanted her, had her!


00:36:42.458 --> 00:36:43.458
Antek!


00:36:45.250 --> 00:36:47.125
For the fear of god, lads!


00:36:47.166 --> 00:36:48.500
Stop! Stop!


00:36:48.541 --> 00:36:49.541
Enough!


00:36:51.291 --> 00:36:53.208
Enough, enough!


00:36:59.583 --> 00:37:01.666
A worthless bitch.


00:37:03.375 --> 00:37:05.250
You're just too old to realise


00:37:05.875 --> 00:37:08.000
that you've paid more
than others would.


00:37:13.666 --> 00:37:14.750
Leave.


00:37:15.666 --> 00:37:18.458
Come sunrise, I don't want to set
eyes on you in this place again.


00:37:59.500 --> 00:38:00.875
Why so gloomy?


00:38:01.791 --> 00:38:03.708
Don't be like this with Boryna.


00:38:03.750 --> 00:38:06.083
Be soft, be gentle


00:38:06.875 --> 00:38:10.833
maybe he'll settle more land on you,
or toss a pretty penny your way.


00:38:10.875 --> 00:38:12.291
I don't care for pennies!


00:38:13.500 --> 00:38:15.791
There must be something
more important in life.


00:38:19.458 --> 00:38:21.041
Have you no fear of God?


00:38:21.083 --> 00:38:22.458
Foolish girl.


00:38:23.750 --> 00:38:24.958
Look.


00:38:25.000 --> 00:38:26.041
Look!


00:38:26.083 --> 00:38:27.583
Your settlement from Boryna,


00:38:27.625 --> 00:38:29.791
six acres of pure soil!


00:38:30.875 --> 00:38:33.791
Do you think that you'd be
happy without that holy soil?


00:38:34.458 --> 00:38:36.541
God did not create
you to be poor!


00:38:36.583 --> 00:38:37.583
No!


00:38:50.416 --> 00:38:51.875
Love comes and goes,


00:38:52.875 --> 00:38:54.416
but land stays.


00:39:12.583 --> 00:39:15.708
Welcome! Drink people, drink!


00:39:15.750 --> 00:39:18.875
Drink, my dears!


00:41:45.625 --> 00:41:49.166
In the name of the Father,
the Son and the Holy Spirit.


00:41:53.416 --> 00:41:55.125
Eat something.


00:41:55.166 --> 00:41:57.000
Look at her! A grand lady!


00:41:57.791 --> 00:42:00.916
The first lady of Lipce now,


00:42:00.958 --> 00:42:02.708
and she sits there
like at a funeral.


00:42:03.291 --> 00:42:04.416
She's overwhelmed!


00:42:04.458 --> 00:42:07.166
She's a beauty though.
I'll give her that.


00:42:07.833 --> 00:42:09.458
Why wouldn't she be,


00:42:09.500 --> 00:42:11.333
when all she does
is sleep and eat.


00:42:11.375 --> 00:42:14.541
And lies behind every bush
with anyone in trousers!


00:42:14.583 --> 00:42:17.000
Zoska, in the name
of the Holy Virgin!


00:42:17.041 --> 00:42:19.208
This is no place
for such gossip!


00:42:19.250 --> 00:42:21.333
I give it 'til spring,


00:42:21.375 --> 00:42:24.666
she'll be bored by then
and chasing farmhands.


00:42:24.708 --> 00:42:26.125
Her mother was just the same!


00:42:26.166 --> 00:42:27.958
Jagustynka!


00:42:28.583 --> 00:42:29.833
Aren't I right?


00:42:29.875 --> 00:42:31.708
She prays away now,


00:42:32.375 --> 00:42:34.791
because she's wrinkled
as a potato after winter!


00:42:35.875 --> 00:42:39.125
But she fell to her knees for
other reasons in her youth.


00:42:39.958 --> 00:42:41.708
Now, she'll feel at home.


00:42:42.958 --> 00:42:44.833
And help herself
to mother's things.


00:42:44.875 --> 00:42:46.916
Let's drink!


00:42:48.875 --> 00:42:50.125
We'll fight for what's ours.


00:42:50.166 --> 00:42:51.666
One! Two...


00:43:01.083 --> 00:43:03.500
Look, mother! How
beautiful our Jagna is.


00:44:31.833 --> 00:44:35.625
There's never been such
a wedding in Lipce,


00:44:35.666 --> 00:44:37.958
nor will there be again.


00:44:38.958 --> 00:44:42.375
Ah! Jagna, my beauty!


00:44:42.416 --> 00:44:43.750
I have to rejoin the guests!


00:44:43.791 --> 00:44:45.708
Aww... What a hostess!


00:44:46.375 --> 00:44:48.375
- Drink, young lady!
- Bottoms up!


00:44:48.416 --> 00:44:49.500
Your health!


00:48:08.375 --> 00:48:10.750
I hear they are
hiring at the mill.


00:48:12.791 --> 00:48:13.875
I told you already!


00:48:14.875 --> 00:48:16.583
I'll not work for
the peasants here.


00:48:17.541 --> 00:48:18.541
Maybe


00:48:19.333 --> 00:48:20.916
I could work there.


00:48:20.958 --> 00:48:22.041
Don't be daft, dad!


00:48:23.875 --> 00:48:26.250
Antek, we're living
on potatoes and salt.


00:48:27.000 --> 00:48:28.541
I won't work in Lipce!


00:48:29.083 --> 00:48:31.875
It's more than three weeks
since anyone's spoken to me.


00:48:32.250 --> 00:48:34.041
You fought with your father.


00:48:34.083 --> 00:48:36.750
Don't other lads fight
with their fathers?


00:48:38.083 --> 00:48:41.125
Maybe, but you're the only
one whose father is Boryna!


00:48:42.500 --> 00:48:44.041
Let them spit on
me. You want that?


00:48:44.083 --> 00:48:46.583
It's not about what I want,
it's about what we need!


00:49:02.750 --> 00:49:04.208
And the old man,


00:49:04.250 --> 00:49:07.416
he boils her milk,
makes her tea.


00:49:07.458 --> 00:49:08.708
Brings it to her bed.


00:49:09.583 --> 00:49:11.166
He can wait on
her hand and foot,


00:49:11.916 --> 00:49:14.333
but Jagna will go back to
her old ways soon enough!


00:49:15.166 --> 00:49:17.916
I heard that she's
frisky for her stepson.


00:49:18.791 --> 00:49:19.791
Nah!


00:49:20.375 --> 00:49:23.875
All the gossip about them
knowing each other is not true!


00:49:24.500 --> 00:49:25.750
I heard


00:49:25.791 --> 00:49:27.250
that he'd whine at her door,


00:49:27.291 --> 00:49:29.500
and she had to chase
him off with a broom!


00:49:30.083 --> 00:49:31.958
Many a time she
complained to me.


00:49:32.875 --> 00:49:36.208
- Wasn't I in her bedroom more than once?
- Not the first, nor the last!


00:49:38.583 --> 00:49:39.791
You're lying.


00:49:42.291 --> 00:49:43.625
What did you say?


00:49:44.333 --> 00:49:46.125
You're lying, you scum!


00:49:49.666 --> 00:49:50.666
Boys!


00:49:52.291 --> 00:49:53.375
Stop!


00:49:55.000 --> 00:49:56.000
Antek!


00:50:01.083 --> 00:50:02.166
Mateusz!


00:50:03.375 --> 00:50:05.750
Jesus, he's gone straight
under the wheels.


00:50:05.791 --> 00:50:07.458
If anyone else bothers Jagna,


00:50:08.000 --> 00:50:09.500
they'll get the same.


00:50:11.666 --> 00:50:12.500
Mateusz!


00:50:12.541 --> 00:50:13.583
He's alive?


00:50:14.458 --> 00:50:15.833
He's alive!


00:50:15.875 --> 00:50:16.875
He's alive!


00:50:24.708 --> 00:50:26.125
- Beautiful!
- It's not!


00:50:26.666 --> 00:50:28.333
Witek, is the stove hot yet?


00:50:31.500 --> 00:50:33.083
I'll bring more wood.


00:50:33.125 --> 00:50:34.291
Close the door!


00:50:34.750 --> 00:50:35.958
The cold is getting in!


00:50:41.666 --> 00:50:42.875
Master Jasio!


00:50:43.375 --> 00:50:45.041
Praised be Jesus Christ!


00:50:45.083 --> 00:50:46.083
For ever and ever.


00:50:46.500 --> 00:50:48.708
- I bring the altar breads.
- Welcome, Jasio!


00:50:49.166 --> 00:50:50.041
Good day.


00:50:50.083 --> 00:50:51.583
Back from school already?


00:50:51.875 --> 00:50:53.416
Since Sunday, three days ago.


00:50:54.208 --> 00:50:55.416
What's new?


00:50:55.458 --> 00:50:58.333
Everything goes quietly
with us peasants, as usual.


00:50:58.375 --> 00:50:59.500
Quietly?


00:50:59.541 --> 00:51:00.916
What about your wedding?


00:51:00.958 --> 00:51:02.041
There was so much fun


00:51:02.083 --> 00:51:04.333
that people were
dancing for three days!


00:51:05.666 --> 00:51:07.666
Look at Jagna's cutouts!


00:51:15.916 --> 00:51:16.916
Very beautiful.


00:51:18.291 --> 00:51:19.291
Truly.


00:51:20.458 --> 00:51:21.875
- I passed Antek.
- Oh yes?


00:51:21.916 --> 00:51:24.625
He's grown so thin.
He looked weary.


00:51:24.666 --> 00:51:26.541
Weary indeed.


00:51:27.166 --> 00:51:28.875
He wore himself out


00:51:30.875 --> 00:51:33.875
while breaking Mateusz's ribs!


00:51:34.833 --> 00:51:36.500
Thank you for your hospitality.


00:51:37.083 --> 00:51:38.625
And... Merry Christmas!


00:51:38.666 --> 00:51:40.041
Goodbye, Jasio!


00:51:40.083 --> 00:51:42.291
God be with you, Jasio!


00:51:45.708 --> 00:51:47.875
What's going on? Why
were they fighting?


00:51:47.916 --> 00:51:48.916
Why,


00:51:48.958 --> 00:51:50.208
over you, of course.


00:51:51.208 --> 00:51:53.833
Like dogs over a bitch in heat!


00:51:53.875 --> 00:51:56.500
- You're lying like a dog!
- I'm telling the truth!


00:51:57.000 --> 00:51:58.916
Mateusz was boasting
to the peasants


00:51:58.958 --> 00:52:01.250
that he spends time
in your bedroom.


00:52:02.166 --> 00:52:05.375
So Antek near beat him to death!


00:52:06.250 --> 00:52:08.000
Worry not, love.


00:52:08.416 --> 00:52:11.708
Antek would fight
the world for you.


00:52:19.666 --> 00:52:22.000
- Happy Christmas!
- God be with you!


00:52:22.041 --> 00:52:23.791
Happy Christmas!


00:52:35.583 --> 00:52:38.166
Did you see, Maciej, what
we sent with the farmhand?


00:52:39.375 --> 00:52:42.833
Ah, yes, fine work,
Michal. Thank you.


00:52:42.875 --> 00:52:45.083
I see you're wearing
mother's hat.


00:52:47.583 --> 00:52:48.708
It suits you.


00:52:50.416 --> 00:52:51.583
Let's go.


00:53:10.875 --> 00:53:12.208
Jagna


00:53:12.791 --> 00:53:14.583
come to the floodmeadow one day.


00:53:15.750 --> 00:53:17.458
- I have a husband.
- Yes, you have.


00:53:18.208 --> 00:53:19.708
My father.


00:53:22.291 --> 00:53:23.708
Can you change that?


00:53:47.083 --> 00:53:48.666
Easy...


00:53:49.583 --> 00:53:50.958
I come in peace.


00:53:58.416 --> 00:54:00.500
You shamed me in front
of the whole world.


00:54:01.458 --> 00:54:02.666
You beat me so badly,


00:54:03.375 --> 00:54:04.875
they even summoned the priest!


00:54:06.666 --> 00:54:08.416
But I am not holding a grudge.


00:54:09.375 --> 00:54:12.041
Why were you lying to the lads?


00:54:12.083 --> 00:54:14.208
I only said those things
because I was angry...


00:54:16.458 --> 00:54:18.208
What's Jagna to me now!


00:54:28.083 --> 00:54:29.208
Welcome!


00:54:29.708 --> 00:54:31.041
- Welcome!
- Praised be!


00:54:31.083 --> 00:54:33.083
Praised... Are
they in the alcove?


00:54:33.875 --> 00:54:34.958
Come, Jagna.


00:54:40.583 --> 00:54:41.958
Forget about it


00:54:42.000 --> 00:54:43.208
while you still can.


00:54:43.250 --> 00:54:44.666
How can I?


00:54:46.041 --> 00:54:48.708
When it runs through
my bones like fire.


00:54:49.583 --> 00:54:50.875
Don't I know it!


00:54:52.083 --> 00:54:54.166
Didn't I chase after her myself?


00:54:55.958 --> 00:54:57.375
But she preferred you.


00:54:59.791 --> 00:55:01.250
The Squire has no right!


00:55:04.208 --> 00:55:06.666
Yet he's sold logging
rights in Wolf Hollow!


00:55:08.333 --> 00:55:10.416
Lipce has always
had rights there!


00:55:10.458 --> 00:55:12.583
He owns the wood.


00:55:13.791 --> 00:55:15.833
But we will seek a compromise.


00:55:15.875 --> 00:55:17.083
What compromise?


00:55:18.750 --> 00:55:20.416
The forest is already sold.


00:55:21.375 --> 00:55:23.708
They've marked the trees,
and they'll start cutting.


00:55:23.750 --> 00:55:26.166
Let him mark them, we
won't let him cut them.


00:55:27.958 --> 00:55:29.166
We won't let him.


00:55:49.958 --> 00:55:52.916
- Every day I wait.
- You think I can leave? They watch me.


00:55:52.958 --> 00:55:54.666
Play the volta, boys!


00:55:54.958 --> 00:55:56.500
And make it lively!


00:57:30.916 --> 00:57:33.333
I was only dancing.


00:57:34.500 --> 00:57:36.625
He'll weep someday...


00:57:36.666 --> 00:57:38.500
- Move!
- I was only dancing!


00:57:39.000 --> 00:57:41.416
- Move!
- Leave me!


00:57:56.375 --> 00:57:57.458
Stupid.


00:57:59.083 --> 00:58:01.666
Decorates the house, but
she's blind to all dirt.


00:58:01.708 --> 00:58:03.041
Because it's clean.


00:58:03.083 --> 00:58:05.333
Maybe the illness has
gone to your eyes.


00:58:05.375 --> 00:58:07.833
I swear, when I get
up, you'll regret it!


00:58:07.875 --> 00:58:08.958
Shush, Jagna!


00:58:10.875 --> 00:58:13.291
Go and see if Jozka needs help!


00:58:19.625 --> 00:58:21.250
Come on, it's not her fault.


00:58:21.291 --> 00:58:22.666
Then whose?


00:58:22.708 --> 00:58:25.833
You left her alone and went
drinking in the backroom.


00:58:26.791 --> 00:58:28.375
The music was playing,


00:58:28.416 --> 00:58:29.833
everyone was dancing,


00:58:29.875 --> 00:58:30.750
having fun.


00:58:30.791 --> 00:58:31.958
So...


00:58:32.000 --> 00:58:33.416
So what was she meant to do?


00:58:33.458 --> 00:58:35.333
Stand in a corner
like some old maid?


00:58:35.375 --> 00:58:38.875
Just cure me and don't
give me life lessons.


00:58:44.375 --> 00:58:46.083
I know well enough.


00:59:00.583 --> 00:59:01.833
Hanka?


00:59:01.875 --> 00:59:02.958
Hanka!


00:59:10.416 --> 00:59:12.458
For the love of God, Hanka!


00:59:24.958 --> 00:59:26.958
Stop by some time.


00:59:27.416 --> 00:59:29.375
- Even tomorrow.
- You drove us out.


00:59:30.375 --> 00:59:32.375
So how could I come to you?


00:59:38.500 --> 00:59:40.666
I can't let you and my
grandchildren starve.


01:00:15.083 --> 01:00:21.083
<i>In the cherry orchard,</i>
walked a pretty lass,


01:00:23.250 --> 01:00:27.083
<i>searching for her
lost innocence.</i>


01:00:31.666 --> 01:00:32.875
It's the revellers!


01:00:32.916 --> 01:00:34.166
The revellers are here!


01:02:33.666 --> 01:02:34.833
Fire...


01:02:37.416 --> 01:02:38.416
Fire!


01:02:38.958 --> 01:02:40.916
Fire!


01:02:40.958 --> 01:02:43.291
People, fire!


01:02:50.083 --> 01:02:51.625
Jagna's apron!


01:02:51.666 --> 01:02:54.125
Gimme, gimme! Keep working.


01:02:54.166 --> 01:02:56.333
They say that Boryna
caught them in the hay,


01:02:56.375 --> 01:02:58.666
and that's when
the fire started.


01:02:58.708 --> 01:03:01.916
Antek did it, for
sure, out of spite!


01:03:01.958 --> 01:03:03.041
Did you see it?


01:03:03.083 --> 01:03:04.250
Did you see him light it?


01:03:04.750 --> 01:03:07.333
Then what are you
blabbering for?


01:03:08.083 --> 01:03:11.708
I heard the old man beat her so
badly that she's still lying ill.


01:03:12.625 --> 01:03:15.666
- I said it would end this way!
- That's enough!


01:03:15.708 --> 01:03:16.708
Quiet!


01:03:25.416 --> 01:03:27.166
I see you've been begging.


01:03:28.166 --> 01:03:31.208
Since you make us live like beggars,
I seek compassion elsewhere.


01:03:32.750 --> 01:03:33.916
You have no shame.


01:03:45.416 --> 01:03:46.916
Is it father's?


01:03:48.041 --> 01:03:49.500
I told you, damn it!


01:03:49.541 --> 01:03:50.916
Not to go to him.


01:03:50.958 --> 01:03:52.833
He invited me, so I went.


01:03:52.875 --> 01:03:55.708
I won't let me and the children
go hungry because you don't care.


01:03:55.750 --> 01:03:57.125
Take it back! Now!


01:03:57.166 --> 01:03:58.666
I don't need anything from him!


01:03:58.708 --> 01:04:00.333
But the children
do, and so do I!


01:04:00.375 --> 01:04:01.625
Take it back!


01:04:01.666 --> 01:04:04.125
Or I'll take it and
shove it down his throat!


01:04:04.166 --> 01:04:05.875
He can choke on his charity.


01:04:11.375 --> 01:04:12.541
Try it!


01:04:12.583 --> 01:04:14.083
Touch it and you'll see!


01:04:15.000 --> 01:04:16.375
He bought you cheap.


01:04:17.666 --> 01:04:19.000
With a crust of bread


01:04:19.375 --> 01:04:20.500
like a stray dog.


01:04:21.458 --> 01:04:23.625
You've sold us even cheaper.


01:04:24.166 --> 01:04:25.708
For a scrap of Jagna's skirt.


01:04:27.666 --> 01:04:28.750
Go on!


01:04:28.791 --> 01:04:30.375
Run to your bitch!


01:04:49.250 --> 01:04:51.666
Lipce must fight!


01:04:54.416 --> 01:04:56.875
Today they took our wood.


01:04:58.208 --> 01:05:00.041
If we don't defend ourselves,


01:05:00.083 --> 01:05:02.416
tomorrow they will
snatch our land,


01:05:02.458 --> 01:05:03.458
our houses,


01:05:03.500 --> 01:05:04.500
possessions...


01:05:05.750 --> 01:05:07.916
Slaves of the Squire or Boryna,


01:05:09.250 --> 01:05:10.500
what's the difference?


01:05:11.291 --> 01:05:13.333
For God's sake, Jagna,
stop your nonsense!


01:05:14.000 --> 01:05:17.250
It's no wonder he's
punishing you now.


01:05:18.750 --> 01:05:21.333
He's made of flesh and blood,


01:05:21.375 --> 01:05:23.208
not paper like your cutouts.


01:05:24.791 --> 01:05:26.291
He's your husband!


01:05:30.958 --> 01:05:32.208
Not one I chose.


01:05:58.375 --> 01:05:59.708
Do you love me?


01:06:00.250 --> 01:06:02.083
Haven't I said so?


01:06:03.791 --> 01:06:05.875
Don't I come out to see
you whenever you want?


01:06:05.916 --> 01:06:07.541
You love me indeed.


01:06:08.791 --> 01:06:11.291
Like some mad dog who can bite,


01:06:11.875 --> 01:06:13.708
and you can't get rid of!


01:06:18.083 --> 01:06:19.583
I have to go now.


01:06:21.791 --> 01:06:23.666
If I've gone to the dogs,


01:06:24.250 --> 01:06:25.375
it is because of you!


01:06:25.916 --> 01:06:27.750
Because I loved you.
Do you understand?


01:06:27.791 --> 01:06:29.041
You love me?


01:06:29.083 --> 01:06:31.041
You only take it out on me!


01:06:31.083 --> 01:06:32.291
What?


01:06:33.083 --> 01:06:34.666
You need another already?


01:06:37.750 --> 01:06:39.375
You think I ever wanted you?


01:06:39.958 --> 01:06:41.500
Boryna's farmhand?


01:07:01.208 --> 01:07:02.208
People!


01:07:02.583 --> 01:07:04.375
We have suffered an injustice!


01:07:04.416 --> 01:07:07.083
An injustice we cannot tolerate!


01:07:08.125 --> 01:07:10.166
We have rights in Wolf's Hollow!


01:07:11.166 --> 01:07:13.958
The forest is ours! And the
Squire is cutting it down!


01:07:15.083 --> 01:07:17.083
We complained - in vain!


01:07:17.833 --> 01:07:19.958
We took the Squire to the court!


01:07:20.541 --> 01:07:21.541
Justice was denied us.


01:07:22.041 --> 01:07:24.041
But enough is enough!


01:07:24.333 --> 01:07:26.041
They are cutting down our wood!


01:07:26.583 --> 01:07:28.708
- Are we going to let them?
- NO!!!


01:07:28.750 --> 01:07:30.583
We must defend what's
ours ourselves!


01:07:31.083 --> 01:07:32.625
Look, it's a mob!


01:07:33.166 --> 01:07:34.166
Fetch the horsemen.


01:07:34.833 --> 01:07:36.708
Don't be afraid, people!


01:07:39.625 --> 01:07:43.166
It's our rights, our
will, our justice!


01:07:43.958 --> 01:07:46.000
All together, people!


01:07:46.708 --> 01:07:48.583
Follow me, people!
To the forest!


01:07:48.625 --> 01:07:50.208
To the forest!


01:07:50.250 --> 01:07:51.541
Don't just stand there! Attack!


01:08:02.583 --> 01:08:04.833
Jagustynka, take women
and smash their shacks.


01:08:16.750 --> 01:08:17.958
Horsemen!


01:08:19.166 --> 01:08:20.666
Watch out, lads!


01:08:21.625 --> 01:08:22.958
Come on, lads!


01:08:23.625 --> 01:08:25.750
Rally round, don't give up!


01:08:31.833 --> 01:08:33.666
Son of a bitch!


01:08:34.666 --> 01:08:36.958
Get the horses!


01:09:21.625 --> 01:09:22.708
Boryna!


01:09:56.791 --> 01:09:57.791
Father!


01:10:01.000 --> 01:10:02.916
Show me Anton Boryna!


01:10:03.666 --> 01:10:04.625
Soldiers.


01:10:04.666 --> 01:10:05.750
Father!


01:10:06.583 --> 01:10:08.416
Is that you, my son?


01:10:10.416 --> 01:10:11.708
It's you...


01:10:12.875 --> 01:10:15.208
He was defending his father!


01:10:15.250 --> 01:10:16.375
Justice is on our side!


01:10:18.833 --> 01:10:19.875
You're all


01:10:20.708 --> 01:10:22.125
under arrest!


01:10:27.083 --> 01:10:28.083
Father.


01:10:28.541 --> 01:10:30.208
- I am sorry!
- Stand up!


01:10:30.875 --> 01:10:32.041
You're coming with me.


01:10:38.916 --> 01:10:42.041
We fly to thy protection,
O Holy Mother of God;


01:10:43.958 --> 01:10:46.333
Do not despise our petitions
in our necessities,


01:10:47.416 --> 01:10:49.500
but deliver us always
from all dangers...


01:11:30.041 --> 01:11:32.791
I thought only peasants
are up at this hour?


01:11:34.166 --> 01:11:36.875
Folks like blacksmiths don't
need to get up at dawn.


01:11:38.250 --> 01:11:40.541
With father ill, and Antek
and the rest in jail.


01:11:40.583 --> 01:11:41.625
I thought I'd check...


01:11:42.541 --> 01:11:44.500
- If you need anything.
- No need, thanks.


01:11:44.541 --> 01:11:47.458
I'm keeping my eye on
things, as father asked.


01:11:48.083 --> 01:11:49.875
Four eyes can see more than two.


01:11:55.041 --> 01:11:57.666
- I'll wait until Jagna's up.
- Wait all you want.


01:12:01.291 --> 01:12:02.666
Get out, Hanka!


01:12:04.541 --> 01:12:06.416
Quiet! There's a sick man here.


01:12:07.083 --> 01:12:08.500
Not that you care.


01:12:10.666 --> 01:12:13.625
He could be starving to death
before you'd lift a finger.


01:12:13.666 --> 01:12:15.208
You heiress.


01:12:15.833 --> 01:12:18.125
My husband is my
business, not yours.


01:12:18.166 --> 01:12:21.291
The whole farm would go to ruin
if you had the running of it.


01:12:22.625 --> 01:12:24.708
That's why father
put me in charge.


01:12:28.000 --> 01:12:30.291
And go feed that
whining cow of yours!


01:13:02.583 --> 01:13:03.833
Father didn't say anything?


01:13:03.875 --> 01:13:04.875
Jesus!


01:13:05.250 --> 01:13:06.708
- Michal!
- Sorry, Jagna.


01:13:06.750 --> 01:13:08.625
I didn't mean to scare you.


01:13:09.750 --> 01:13:11.250
I came to see how father is.


01:13:13.958 --> 01:13:15.000
Did he say anything?


01:13:15.916 --> 01:13:16.916
No.


01:13:19.166 --> 01:13:22.750
The organist told me that
Father has a lot of cash.


01:13:27.458 --> 01:13:29.208
He probably hid it
in the storeroom.


01:13:31.541 --> 01:13:34.458
Let's split the money evenly
before Hanka steals everything.


01:13:35.750 --> 01:13:38.000
Just give me the key, Jagna.


01:13:38.958 --> 01:13:40.416
Hanka has the keys now.


01:13:43.250 --> 01:13:45.583
Don't turn your back on me
when I'm talking to you.


01:13:58.041 --> 01:13:59.750
You doing the
shopping now, Jagna?


01:14:04.750 --> 01:14:06.541
It would probably
be easier for you


01:14:08.041 --> 01:14:09.625
if they let Antek out?


01:14:11.333 --> 01:14:12.666
I can make enquiries.


01:14:14.541 --> 01:14:15.875
I have influence.


01:14:18.333 --> 01:14:19.375
Come.


01:14:20.791 --> 01:14:21.791
Sit down with me.


01:14:23.166 --> 01:14:24.541
We'll figure it out.


01:14:24.583 --> 01:14:28.208
If you have such influence then
why are the men still in jail?


01:14:29.333 --> 01:14:31.000
Just for defending
what's theirs?


01:14:31.041 --> 01:14:32.458
Don't sulk, Jagna.


01:14:35.208 --> 01:14:36.750
I am on your side!


01:14:38.416 --> 01:14:39.791
I can help with Antek.


01:14:43.833 --> 01:14:44.958
Keep cranking!


01:15:12.291 --> 01:15:13.500
Hanka!


01:15:16.041 --> 01:15:17.291
Why are you yelling?


01:15:17.333 --> 01:15:19.458
You hung that over my bed!


01:15:19.500 --> 01:15:21.000
That was the only place for it.


01:15:21.041 --> 01:15:22.250
Doesn't it suit you?


01:15:22.708 --> 01:15:24.750
If you get hungry, you
can rip a piece off.


01:15:25.458 --> 01:15:27.625
Since you always take
what others worked for.


01:15:28.583 --> 01:15:30.125
Let her go, if she
wants to fight.


01:15:31.125 --> 01:15:32.166
Try it, bitch!


01:15:32.208 --> 01:15:35.750
I'll scratch that dainty face so even
your own mother won't recognise you.


01:15:35.791 --> 01:15:36.791
Ha... Hanka!


01:15:45.708 --> 01:15:46.791
Hanka


01:15:47.833 --> 01:15:48.958
throw them out.


01:15:49.583 --> 01:15:51.875
Are you in pain?


01:15:53.125 --> 01:15:54.791
Throw them all out.


01:16:15.041 --> 01:16:17.458
In the storeroom. In the wheat.


01:16:18.333 --> 01:16:20.041
In the wheat barrel.


01:16:21.125 --> 01:16:22.916
You will find some
money. Hide it!


01:16:24.041 --> 01:16:25.625
So they don't take it from you.


01:16:28.000 --> 01:16:29.375
Save Antek.


01:16:31.750 --> 01:16:33.750
Don't let them take it.


01:16:34.250 --> 01:16:35.333
It's yours.


01:16:37.541 --> 01:16:38.833
All yours.


01:16:50.250 --> 01:16:52.166
You said you could help Antek.


01:16:53.000 --> 01:16:55.291
All in good time.


01:17:08.958 --> 01:17:10.583
Come, Jagna, come.


01:17:11.250 --> 01:17:13.458
Let's rest here.


01:17:17.458 --> 01:17:19.916
- Look!
- There's nothing to see here.


01:17:23.166 --> 01:17:27.041
Come here, Jagna, come now...


01:17:46.916 --> 01:17:48.583
I'm sorry.


01:17:49.166 --> 01:17:50.458
I got carried away.


01:17:53.458 --> 01:17:56.416
Touch me again, you pig, and
I'll tell the whole world.


01:17:56.458 --> 01:17:57.458
Tell them...


01:17:57.500 --> 01:17:59.250
As if anyone would believe you.


01:20:16.625 --> 01:20:18.708
Come, farmer.


01:20:26.958 --> 01:20:28.791
Time to sow.


01:20:38.875 --> 01:20:40.958
Time to sow...


01:20:55.916 --> 01:20:59.250
Time to sow...


01:21:52.541 --> 01:21:58.541
Dear God, giver of
salvation and forgiveness.


01:22:00.125 --> 01:22:06.125
We ask for your mercy to
take Boryna, your servant.


01:22:06.916 --> 01:22:11.958
By the grace of the Virgin
Mary and all the Saints.


01:22:12.000 --> 01:22:18.000
To you, with eternal blessing,


01:22:19.041 --> 01:22:25.041
For Jesus Christ,
our Lord, Amen.


01:23:02.416 --> 01:23:03.958
Come to me...


01:23:40.208 --> 01:23:41.416
So, what's new, Hanka?


01:23:41.458 --> 01:23:43.916
Everything is as usual.
Plenty of work to be done.


01:23:43.958 --> 01:23:44.958
As usual?


01:23:47.541 --> 01:23:48.750
You took father's money?


01:23:48.791 --> 01:23:51.250
You would steal it and you
think everyone is like you?


01:23:53.958 --> 01:23:55.708
What you've stolen is yours.


01:23:56.208 --> 01:23:57.625
But the land must be divided.


01:23:58.250 --> 01:23:59.541
I'll not give it up.


01:24:00.166 --> 01:24:03.291
I'm just minding my husband's
property. I've no rights here.


01:24:03.833 --> 01:24:06.125
Now that father's dead,
Antek is in charge.


01:24:06.166 --> 01:24:07.291
It's all up to him.


01:24:07.333 --> 01:24:09.875
In charge of his
prison cell, maybe.


01:24:10.583 --> 01:24:13.041
But honest people will
make the decisions here.


01:24:13.083 --> 01:24:15.875
Honest! Look at him!


01:24:16.708 --> 01:24:19.041
You're only looking to
grab as much as you can.


01:24:23.833 --> 01:24:24.958
Oh, poor little thing.


01:24:26.583 --> 01:24:29.041
Sitting pretty on six
acres of our finest land.


01:24:30.583 --> 01:24:31.916
You're right, Hanka.


01:24:33.458 --> 01:24:34.708
Let's wait,


01:24:35.708 --> 01:24:37.333
for Antek to return.


01:24:39.625 --> 01:24:41.750
He can settle with this harlot.


01:24:49.541 --> 01:24:52.458
I wish I'd broken my legs rather
than ever enter this house.


01:24:52.500 --> 01:24:55.250
No one's tied you down. You
were free to leave anytime.


01:24:58.083 --> 01:25:00.916
And don't spit at me. After
all you've done to me.


01:25:00.958 --> 01:25:02.291
What have I done?


01:25:03.125 --> 01:25:05.208
Stolen things? Killed somebody?


01:25:05.250 --> 01:25:08.958
You chased him like a bitch in heat.
When you knew he had a wife and children.


01:25:09.000 --> 01:25:10.333
Oh, I chased him, did I?


01:25:11.208 --> 01:25:13.375
You don't see his faults?


01:25:14.583 --> 01:25:17.583
How he was pinning at my door
even for a glimpse of my shoe.


01:25:18.375 --> 01:25:20.625
It was he who befuddled
me, and did as he pleased.


01:25:24.291 --> 01:25:25.916
You want the truth?


01:25:25.958 --> 01:25:27.416
But you'll regret it.


01:25:27.916 --> 01:25:29.375
If I would want him,


01:25:29.416 --> 01:25:30.958
no matter what you do


01:25:31.000 --> 01:25:32.125
he'd kick you out,


01:25:32.166 --> 01:25:33.750
and follow me all
over the world.


01:25:33.791 --> 01:25:36.000
Remember this and don't
think that you are my equal.


01:25:36.041 --> 01:25:37.541
Get out of this house now!


01:25:37.583 --> 01:25:38.750
Get out!


01:25:40.833 --> 01:25:43.833
Don't let Antek turn
away from us again.


01:25:46.958 --> 01:25:48.333
Here! Is this what you want?


01:25:48.375 --> 01:25:49.375
These acres?


01:25:49.916 --> 01:25:51.083
Take them then,


01:25:51.125 --> 01:25:53.041
and I hope you choke
on them to death!


01:27:29.250 --> 01:27:30.500
Jagna.


01:27:34.208 --> 01:27:35.333
Don't touch me.


01:27:35.833 --> 01:27:37.583
You had something
to say. So say it.


01:27:38.375 --> 01:27:40.208
Don't be afraid of me! Jagna!


01:27:49.250 --> 01:27:50.791
I hardly recognise you!


01:27:51.666 --> 01:27:53.750
Well, as you left me, so I am.


01:27:54.291 --> 01:27:55.458
I never left you.


01:27:58.000 --> 01:27:59.875
I was thinking about
you day and night.


01:28:01.000 --> 01:28:02.916
Maybe you had something
else on your mind?


01:28:02.958 --> 01:28:03.958
Yes, I did.


01:28:04.333 --> 01:28:07.583
- I was thinking of how you disgraced me.
- I disgraced you?


01:28:08.833 --> 01:28:11.083
Did I tell you to
become my stepmother?


01:28:11.791 --> 01:28:14.500
Did I force you to run
around with the Mayor?


01:28:28.708 --> 01:28:29.708
Jagna.


01:28:31.291 --> 01:28:33.208
Would you go out into
the world with me?


01:28:44.583 --> 01:28:45.708
Antek, no!


01:30:02.708 --> 01:30:04.291
What a drought!


01:30:11.958 --> 01:30:14.541
We were so worried about you.


01:30:16.666 --> 01:30:18.541
Happily Hanka managed
to bail you out!


01:30:22.833 --> 01:30:24.250
Worried, were you?


01:30:25.625 --> 01:30:26.750
Of course!


01:30:29.000 --> 01:30:30.875
You are the first farmer now.


01:30:47.375 --> 01:30:49.291
Two sacks for you, mistress.


01:30:50.333 --> 01:30:51.375
Hanka.


01:30:52.583 --> 01:30:55.041
How easily the
inheritance falls to you.


01:30:55.833 --> 01:30:58.791
Now you only need to kick out
Jozka and all will be yours.


01:31:01.916 --> 01:31:03.375
Got your eye on Jagna already?


01:31:04.416 --> 01:31:06.500
- She's only just widowed.
- I don't.


01:31:06.958 --> 01:31:09.375
Just saying Hanka had no
right kicking her out.


01:31:09.416 --> 01:31:11.625
- It was Jagna's home.
- It was not.


01:31:11.666 --> 01:31:13.666
It's back where it
belongs, with the family.


01:31:14.125 --> 01:31:15.250
Are you sure?


01:31:16.208 --> 01:31:18.875
Her mother has filed
Jagna's claim at the court?


01:31:20.083 --> 01:31:23.375
They'll get her property back.


01:31:25.375 --> 01:31:26.375
We'll see.


01:31:36.291 --> 01:31:37.458
Jagna.


01:31:39.583 --> 01:31:41.750
People are complaining
about you in the village.


01:31:42.166 --> 01:31:43.458
Let them bark.


01:31:44.250 --> 01:31:46.708
They're hot and bothered
and it makes them angry.


01:31:51.375 --> 01:31:52.375
You know...


01:31:55.125 --> 01:31:56.333
The lads


01:31:56.375 --> 01:31:59.083
are already queueing
up to bring you vodka.


01:32:01.333 --> 01:32:02.833
Let them drink it themselves.


01:32:07.500 --> 01:32:09.875
Not all lads are alike.


01:32:11.875 --> 01:32:13.708
Maybe it would


01:32:14.666 --> 01:32:16.208
help


01:32:17.000 --> 01:32:18.250
in the village...


01:32:19.666 --> 01:32:21.083
If you chose someone.


01:32:22.708 --> 01:32:25.041
It would stop people's
tongues wagging.


01:32:25.083 --> 01:32:27.000
I don't need help from men.


01:32:33.458 --> 01:32:35.500
I've had enough of
their help already.


01:32:38.791 --> 01:32:40.125
Jagna, my dear child.


01:32:41.250 --> 01:32:42.375
Haven't you slept?


01:32:45.458 --> 01:32:48.916
Why did you reject Mateusz?


01:32:48.958 --> 01:32:50.583
He's a good carpenter.


01:32:53.541 --> 01:32:55.666
Wasn't that Jesus's profession?


01:32:56.958 --> 01:32:58.625
He has his past,


01:32:59.208 --> 01:33:00.541
but so do you now.


01:33:01.458 --> 01:33:02.833
I don't want Mateusz.


01:33:02.875 --> 01:33:05.083
- I don't want any man.
- Don't talk like that!


01:33:06.916 --> 01:33:08.625
You need to go to confession.


01:33:08.666 --> 01:33:11.375
You can do penance and with
time people will forgive you.


01:33:12.000 --> 01:33:13.250
I won't go to confession.


01:33:13.958 --> 01:33:15.416
Fear the Lord, child.


01:33:20.750 --> 01:33:22.208
Praise be to God.


01:33:23.750 --> 01:33:25.416
Praise be, Hanka.


01:33:25.458 --> 01:33:26.750
I'm going on a pilgrimage.


01:33:26.791 --> 01:33:29.291
Please forgive any sins
I committed against you.


01:33:30.666 --> 01:33:32.416
God bless you for
your kind words.


01:33:33.125 --> 01:33:34.583
But what's done is done.


01:33:36.250 --> 01:33:39.333
I ask you from my
heart for forgiveness.


01:33:42.666 --> 01:33:45.250
I don't hold a
grudge in my heart.


01:33:56.708 --> 01:33:58.291
I'll pray for you.


01:34:20.250 --> 01:34:21.250
Jagna?


01:34:22.208 --> 01:34:25.250
Don't you recognise me?


01:34:25.916 --> 01:34:27.708
How could I not recognise you?


01:34:27.750 --> 01:34:30.875
It's just that you look so
elegant now, so different.


01:34:31.708 --> 01:34:33.458
Clearly coming back
from the world.


01:34:34.416 --> 01:34:36.125
Right now I'm
coming from my home,


01:34:36.166 --> 01:34:37.708
to get a bit of peace.


01:34:38.583 --> 01:34:40.625
- And you?
- Just wandering around.


01:34:44.250 --> 01:34:45.416
Is that a holy book?


01:34:45.458 --> 01:34:47.625
No, it is about faraway
countries, and oceans.


01:34:47.666 --> 01:34:49.583
Jesus! About oceans!


01:34:50.375 --> 01:34:51.500
Have a look!


01:34:54.375 --> 01:34:55.375
Look!


01:34:56.083 --> 01:34:57.291
See this pyramid?


01:34:58.416 --> 01:35:04.166
It's higher than five of our
churches stacked on each other!


01:35:05.000 --> 01:35:06.666
It must be a mountain!


01:35:11.625 --> 01:35:12.833
And what are those?


01:35:12.875 --> 01:35:14.666
They look a bit
like my cut-outs.


01:35:15.208 --> 01:35:18.916
I saw how beautiful your cut-outs
are when I visited at Christmas.


01:35:20.041 --> 01:35:23.458
I haven't seen cut-outs as beautiful
as yours in the markets of Warsaw.


01:35:23.500 --> 01:35:26.041
They've been looking for
you everywhere, Jasio!


01:35:26.083 --> 01:35:27.916
- All over the village.
- I must go.


01:35:27.958 --> 01:35:30.958
Interrupted your
prayers, have I?


01:35:31.416 --> 01:35:32.500
Goodbye.


01:35:34.875 --> 01:35:36.958
A secluded place,


01:35:37.500 --> 01:35:39.958
far from people's eyes.


01:35:40.000 --> 01:35:42.333
May your foul tongue shrivel!


01:35:45.000 --> 01:35:49.125
So I rush off to search,
I look around, and...


01:35:50.125 --> 01:35:52.875
Excuse me, Jasio lost his book.


01:35:53.375 --> 01:35:54.875
What a nerve!


01:35:56.375 --> 01:35:59.208
Get away from here! Never
show your face here again!


01:36:00.125 --> 01:36:02.791
I'll not shed tears
because of you,


01:36:03.208 --> 01:36:05.208
like Hanka and the Mayor's wife!


01:36:05.583 --> 01:36:08.541
I'll teach you not to
conduct your little romances.


01:36:08.583 --> 01:36:11.500
You'll remember me, you hussy!


01:36:12.291 --> 01:36:13.458
To your kennel, bitch!


01:36:18.541 --> 01:36:21.541
I heard that Jagna's now hanging
around the Organist's son.


01:36:23.166 --> 01:36:25.875
Were you so lonely in prison
you've taken to women's gossip?


01:36:25.916 --> 01:36:27.833
I'm only repeating
what people are saying.


01:36:29.583 --> 01:36:32.916
Tell me who said so, and
I'll set them straight.


01:36:40.791 --> 01:36:42.291
I won't give a single zloty!


01:36:44.500 --> 01:36:47.208
Five thousand is missing
from the district's treasury.


01:36:47.250 --> 01:36:49.500
They're taking everything
from them. The whole farm!


01:36:50.000 --> 01:36:52.750
- And if that's not enough,
- Lipce has to pay the rest!


01:36:52.791 --> 01:36:54.458
I'm not going to pay anything!


01:36:54.916 --> 01:36:55.916
People, quiet!


01:36:57.125 --> 01:36:59.958
Don't you know how the
Mayor spent this money?


01:37:01.708 --> 01:37:04.916
- On Jagna!
- That's right! Of course!


01:37:06.416 --> 01:37:08.458
You saw that, did you?


01:37:08.500 --> 01:37:09.583
Don't I know it?


01:37:10.583 --> 01:37:12.833
Am I not ashamed to have
a whore in the family?


01:37:12.875 --> 01:37:14.083
Do something.


01:37:19.750 --> 01:37:21.125
She bewitched my man.


01:37:21.583 --> 01:37:23.083
He'd buy her anything.


01:37:23.625 --> 01:37:26.458
- Whatever she wanted.
- Everyone saw it!


01:37:26.500 --> 01:37:28.208
Where did she get those dresses?


01:37:30.083 --> 01:37:32.875
Because she was Boryna's wife.


01:37:33.375 --> 01:37:36.583
She got all the fancy
clothes from him!


01:37:38.541 --> 01:37:39.541
What do you care?


01:37:40.083 --> 01:37:41.500
Why are on her side?


01:37:42.166 --> 01:37:44.208
Mother of God, save us!


01:37:52.958 --> 01:37:55.208
She even tried to
seduce my Jasio!


01:37:56.958 --> 01:37:59.958
The innocent boy ran
and told me everything!


01:38:00.625 --> 01:38:04.291
What a horror! Not
even a priest is safe!


01:38:05.125 --> 01:38:07.666
Look at the poor
harvest we've had!


01:38:08.375 --> 01:38:10.750
Surely, a whore like that


01:38:11.291 --> 01:38:14.291
has brought God's
wrath upon the village!


01:38:15.000 --> 01:38:17.291
- Time to have end it!
- There's only one way!


01:38:17.833 --> 01:38:18.750
Throw her out!


01:38:18.791 --> 01:38:21.083
- Of course!
- That's how it must be!


01:38:22.500 --> 01:38:23.958
Everyone agreed


01:38:24.583 --> 01:38:26.416
to exile Jagna from the village.


01:38:27.500 --> 01:38:29.166
Say what you think
about it, Antek.


01:38:31.000 --> 01:38:32.500
Well, Antek,


01:38:33.083 --> 01:38:34.416
we're all listening!


01:38:38.333 --> 01:38:40.166
With your father gone,


01:38:41.291 --> 01:38:43.041
you're our first farmer now.


01:38:44.166 --> 01:38:45.833
We can't decide without you.


01:39:01.291 --> 01:39:02.916
I live in the village,


01:39:03.541 --> 01:39:05.125
and I stand with the village.


01:39:08.125 --> 01:39:09.583
You want to expel her,


01:39:10.333 --> 01:39:11.375
then expel her.


01:39:14.625 --> 01:39:17.750
You want to put her on
the altar? Then do that.


01:39:19.375 --> 01:39:20.833
It is all the same to me.


01:39:24.166 --> 01:39:25.333
Antek!


01:39:26.000 --> 01:39:27.000
Good.


01:39:27.333 --> 01:39:28.708
Now we must sort this out.


01:39:35.208 --> 01:39:37.708
Do you know what
they'll do to Jagna?


01:39:41.000 --> 01:39:42.125
The law's


01:39:42.708 --> 01:39:43.750
on their side.


01:39:46.791 --> 01:39:48.541
To hell with such law.


01:39:49.291 --> 01:39:50.708
What they're accusing her of


01:39:50.750 --> 01:39:51.666
it's not true!


01:39:51.708 --> 01:39:53.583
Will you stand against
the whole village?


01:39:53.625 --> 01:39:56.208
- Are you on their side?
- I'm on no one's side.


01:39:57.416 --> 01:39:58.708
I care for her as much,


01:39:59.583 --> 01:40:01.000
as I care for dirt.


01:40:01.708 --> 01:40:02.708
Jesus!


01:40:04.791 --> 01:40:05.958
That you should


01:40:07.666 --> 01:40:10.125
dare to kick out a person like


01:40:12.041 --> 01:40:13.166
a mad dog.


01:40:17.875 --> 01:40:19.041
Antek!


01:40:21.666 --> 01:40:25.041
Your word means something.


01:40:32.000 --> 01:40:33.041
It's too late.


01:41:32.250 --> 01:41:34.791
Mother, the whole village
is coming to get her!


01:41:35.500 --> 01:41:37.083
Quick! Close the door.


01:41:37.125 --> 01:41:39.041
Jagna! Hide!


01:41:39.083 --> 01:41:40.833
I'm not hiding from anyone.


01:41:43.041 --> 01:41:44.166
Together, lads!


01:41:45.625 --> 01:41:46.666
One,


01:41:46.708 --> 01:41:47.708
two,


01:41:48.416 --> 01:41:49.750
three!


01:41:59.541 --> 01:42:02.083
People! People!


01:42:02.125 --> 01:42:05.000
What are you doing?


01:42:12.541 --> 01:42:14.416
Leave Jagna alone!


01:42:14.458 --> 01:42:16.000
Out the way, mother!


01:42:19.250 --> 01:42:20.291
Mama!


01:42:25.541 --> 01:42:26.625
Grab her!


01:42:30.000 --> 01:42:32.416
You'll pay for everything.


01:42:33.375 --> 01:42:37.041
Oh, you'll pay, you whore.


01:42:37.083 --> 01:42:39.333
What now, hussy?


01:42:41.375 --> 01:42:43.583
Not so pretty anymore!


01:42:47.291 --> 01:42:49.500
Take her out!


01:42:49.541 --> 01:42:50.875
To the cart!


01:43:08.125 --> 01:43:11.750
This is for the wrong
you've done to my child!


01:43:16.041 --> 01:43:17.541
Take this, slut!


01:43:24.708 --> 01:43:26.000
- Get her down!
- Bitch!


01:43:26.041 --> 01:43:28.416
For the shame you
brought on the village!


01:43:30.083 --> 01:43:31.958
Get her on the cart!


01:43:34.583 --> 01:43:36.041
Tie her up!


01:43:36.416 --> 01:43:37.416
Take her!


01:44:33.291 --> 01:44:35.125
That's enough!


01:44:46.291 --> 01:44:47.875
Come back to the village,


01:44:48.458 --> 01:44:50.833
and we'll hunt you
down with dogs.

